  "overview": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "attribution": "Supreme Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0b358f00ebdcb50f2d57d179e9abc6a40bda4d307f2c8d677e804102a1145bd4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-0b358f00ebdc-0000-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 1,
              "start": 1
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The case was heard in oral argument before the Supreme Court at 11:09\u202fa.m."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners' counsel Steven M. Shapiro",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0b358f00ebdcb50f2d57d179e9abc6a40bda4d307f2c8d677e804102a1145bd4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-0b358f00ebdc-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioners' counsel Steven M. Shapiro, petitioners argue that the dispute can be decided on statutory grounds, focusing on the appellate review statute and the public record statute, which makes the Tax Court report a public record."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Shapiro",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0b358f00ebdcb50f2d57d179e9abc6a40bda4d307f2c8d677e804102a1145bd4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-0b358f00ebdc-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Shapiro, petitioners contend that the Tax Court report should be part of the appellate record."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Shapiro",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0b358f00ebdcb50f2d57d179e9abc6a40bda4d307f2c8d677e804102a1145bd4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-0b358f00ebdc-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 22,
              "start": 22
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Shapiro, petitioners argue that the report is merely an aid to the decision\u2011maker and should not be given weight."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Shapiro",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0b358f00ebdcb50f2d57d179e9abc6a40bda4d307f2c8d677e804102a1145bd4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-0b358f00ebdc-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 21,
              "start": 21
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Shapiro, the appellate court determines what belongs in the record, as illustrated by the IBM v. United States case."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Shapiro",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0b358f00ebdcb50f2d57d179e9abc6a40bda4d307f2c8d677e804102a1145bd4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-0b358f00ebdc-0003-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 57,
              "start": 57
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Shapiro, rule\u202f183 does not forbid disclosure of the Tax Court report; it is silent on the point."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Hungar",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0b358f00ebdcb50f2d57d179e9abc6a40bda4d307f2c8d677e804102a1145bd4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-0b358f00ebdc-0003-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 54,
              "start": 54
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Hungar, congress has mandated confidentiality of the initial reports and given the Tax Court plenary authority over special\u2011trial judges."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Hungar",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0b358f00ebdcb50f2d57d179e9abc6a40bda4d307f2c8d677e804102a1145bd4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-0b358f00ebdc-0001-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 28,
              "start": 28
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Hungar, both trial\u2011court judges reached the same factual conclusions, indicating a central flaw in the petitioners\u2019 case."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Hungar",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0b358f00ebdcb50f2d57d179e9abc6a40bda4d307f2c8d677e804102a1145bd4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-0b358f00ebdc-0001-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 30,
              "start": 30
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Hungar, the special\u2011trial judge may withdraw and submit a corrected report during deliberations."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Hungar",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0b358f00ebdcb50f2d57d179e9abc6a40bda4d307f2c8d677e804102a1145bd4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-0b358f00ebdc-0001-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Hungar, petitioners seek disclosure of the original Tax Court report."
      }
    ],
